  "company-logo-style": "background-image:url(\"/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/63f501f3fcfc59af991a023a_bagel%20corner.avif\")",
  "title-post-2": "Bagel Corner x Innovorder",
  "rt-blog-html": "\n          <h3>01. The context</h3>\n          <p><strong>Definition of the need</strong></p>\n          <p>Since the launch of its franchise in 2014, <strong>Bagel Corner</strong> has experienced <strong>strong growth</strong>. The brand opens about 15 additional outlets every year, with the goal of eventually reaching 700 restaurants. To meet all the challenges associated with this development, Bagel Corner equipped its network with a <strong>software suite </strong>that was deployed in a few weeks.<br></p>\n          <h3>02. The interview</h3>\n          <p><strong>Watch the video</strong></p>\n          <p><strong>Michael Cohen</strong>, CEO and partner of Bagel Corner, explains how the franchise's growth context led him to choose Innovorder. In order to equip its network of forty points of sale with a complete software suite, Bagel Corner had to face the challenge of <strong>switching over the entire network in an instant, without impacting its business</strong>.</p>\n          <p>Discover in the interview with Michael Cohen the challenges of the collaboration between the bagel specialist and Innovorder!</p>\n          <figure style=\"padding-bottom:56.206088992974244%\" class=\"w-richtext-align-fullwidth w-richtext-figure-type-video\">\n            <div>\n              <iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/LMx2sgoA_oY\" scrolling=\"no\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"true\"></iframe>\n            </div>\n          </figure>\n          <h4>Discover the interview of Alain and Antoine</h4>\n          <h4>What were their issues?</h4>\n          <p>Bagel Corner wanted to <strong>replace its entire cash register system</strong> quickly, so as not to slow down the activity of their franchisees. But also, to <strong>install a 360 device</strong> to accompany their customers throughout the sales process.</p>\n          <p><br></p>\n          <h4>Why did you choose Innovorder?</h4>\n          <p>According to Bagel Corner, Innovorder was the most competent company, and its team, the most friendly. And this collaboration has lasted for more than two years!</p>\n          <p>Beyond this proximity, the franchise network was pleasantly surprised by the ability to deploy Innovorder solutions. The solutions were implemented quickly.</p>\n          <figure style=\"max-width:2048px\" class=\"w-richtext-align-fullwidth w-richtext-figure-type-image\">\n            <div><img alt src=\"/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/63f501f2fcfc5998a819fedf_CEL-mobile-in-situ.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n          </figure>\n        ",
  "right-head": "Bagel Corner",
  "bozzolo-cat": "Franchise",
  "div-html": "\n                  <div role=\"listitem\" class=\"w-dyn-item\"><a href=\"/en/point-of-sales-restaurant\" class=\"solutions-block-item w-inline-block\">\n                      <img src=\"/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/63f501f3fcfc596eea1a0225_Portefeuille-2.avif\" loading=\"lazy\" alt class=\"icon-solution\">\n                      <div>Cash register</div>\n                    </a></div>\n                  <div role=\"listitem\" class=\"w-dyn-item\"><a href=\"/en/self-ordering-kiosk\" class=\"solutions-block-item w-inline-block\">\n                      <img src=\"/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/63f501f3fcfc5975dd1a0229_Borne%20de%20commande.avif\" loading=\"lazy\" alt class=\"icon-solution\">\n                      <div>Self Ordering Kiosk</div>\n                    </a></div>\n                  <div role=\"listitem\" class=\"w-dyn-item\"><a href=\"/en/kitchen-display-system\" class=\"solutions-block-item w-inline-block\">\n                      <img src=\"/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/63f501f3fcfc595abf1a0222_%C3%A9cran%20de%20production.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" alt class=\"icon-solution\">\n                      <div>Kitchen Display System</div>\n                    </a></div>\n                  <div role=\"listitem\" class=\"w-dyn-item\"><a href=\"/en/restaurant-pos-software\" class=\"solutions-block-item w-inline-block\">\n                      <img src=\"/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/63f501f3fcfc5943581a021e_Backoffice.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" alt class=\"icon-solution\">\n                      <div>Back Office</div>\n                    </a></div>\n                ",
